  "description": "Design Agentforce conversations that span multiple turns without losing context: session variable scoping, conversation memory, clarifying-question patterns, topic-to-topic (now subagent) handoff, and the right abstractions for accumulating state across turns. NOT for deciding the topic boundaries themselves or out-of-scope behavior \u2014 use agentforce/agent-topic-design. NOT for single-turn agent actions and their input/output contracts \u2014 use agentforce/agent-actions.",
  "file_location": "skills/agentforce/agentforce-multi-turn-patterns",
  "id": "agentforce/agentforce-multi-turn-patterns",
  "inputs": [
    "Conversation design goals (what info must accumulate across turns)",
    "Topic catalog for the agent",
    "Expected turn count before task completion",
    "Escalation criteria (when to hand off to human)"
  ],
